{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/8c4343f732a3731fef2f4a9d4a8cb639.avif?t=1774373720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras_big/8c4343f732a3731fef2f4a9d4a8cb639.avif?t=1774373720 width=800 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story that you are about to witness is one of horror, slaughter, and terror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Eloise, it was supposed to be a normal babysitting job; free pizza, a sleeping baby, and a few friends sneaking in to keep her company through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, what transpired that evening will shock and horrify you, for the child wasn\u2019t the only thing asleep, and something much older refuses to rest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/fa8d9682f1c5f7e2d093079009964c21.avif?t=1774373720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras_big/fa8d9682f1c5f7e2d093079009964c21.avif?t=1774373720 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro graphics, from retro hardware</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is being developed not only for modern platforms but also for the retro console the Sega\u202fGenesis\u202f/\u202fMega\u202fDrive. The games art style, colour palettes, and overall design embrace the hardwares constraints, adding to an authentic, beautifully crafted 16\u2011bit pixel\u2011art aesthetic that we love.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.poster.avif?t=1774373720\" width=800 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.webm?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.mp4?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/735884e29d50444b007f77cd35b0c7da.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commandable characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eloise doesn't have to be the final girl, and you are not alone. You are joined by two of your best friends. They are there to assist, but they're counting on your instructions to help them survive. Once they're dead, they're dead.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/5220ea11c731fe94559a3db19f277162.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time moves on</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events play out whether you are there or not - plenty to see, miss and catch through on subsequent playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter and have knock-on effects. Multiple endings come down to the choices that you make, the paths you walk down and the friends who get torn apart.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and seek</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many horrors await, and they won't wait passively. They will hunt you room to room, and have their own behaviours and cravings. But they can also be tricked and coerced depending on your survival and stealth skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth + Point and click</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines fast, stealth\u2011based mechanics with our love of point\u2011and\u2011click adventures. Alongside running, hiding, and surviving the horrors that await you, you will solve puzzles and uncover plots... everything you would expect from a quality point\u2011and\u2011click experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of death animations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are sparing no expense when it comes to the multitude of ways you, your friends, and other unlucky strangers can meet their end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/41b8456124e7b421534c4f5cf031e5e4.poster.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/41b8456124e7b421534c4f5cf031e5e4.webm?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note - this game is still in early development and is subject to change.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718500?t=1774373720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718500?t=1774373720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/9a4a68813c1535fbc1a557ada451fe1006da24f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774373720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/9a4a68813c1535fbc1a557ada451fe1006da24f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774373720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"features pixel/retro blood and gore throughout the game."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4468550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/8c4343f732a3731fef2f4a9d4a8cb639.avif?t=1774373720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras_big/8c4343f732a3731fef2f4a9d4a8cb639.avif?t=1774373720 width=800 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story that you are about to witness is one of horror, slaughter, and terror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Eloise, it was supposed to be a normal babysitting job; free pizza, a sleeping baby, and a few friends sneaking in to keep her company through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, what transpired that evening will shock and horrify you, for the child wasn\u2019t the only thing asleep, and something much older refuses to rest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/fa8d9682f1c5f7e2d093079009964c21.avif?t=1774373720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras_big/fa8d9682f1c5f7e2d093079009964c21.avif?t=1774373720 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro graphics, from retro hardware</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is being developed not only for modern platforms but also for the retro console the Sega\u202fGenesis\u202f/\u202fMega\u202fDrive. The games art style, colour palettes, and overall design embrace the hardwares constraints, adding to an authentic, beautifully crafted 16\u2011bit pixel\u2011art aesthetic that we love.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.poster.avif?t=1774373720\" width=800 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.webm?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/bb3bbf4032471377a56d1a55ed254afd.mp4?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/735884e29d50444b007f77cd35b0c7da.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commandable characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eloise doesn't have to be the final girl, and you are not alone. You are joined by two of your best friends. They are there to assist, but they're counting on your instructions to help them survive. Once they're dead, they're dead.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/5220ea11c731fe94559a3db19f277162.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time moves on</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events play out whether you are there or not - plenty to see, miss and catch through on subsequent playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter and have knock-on effects. Multiple endings come down to the choices that you make, the paths you walk down and the friends who get torn apart.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and seek</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many horrors await, and they won't wait passively. They will hunt you room to room, and have their own behaviours and cravings. But they can also be tricked and coerced depending on your survival and stealth skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth + Point and click</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines fast, stealth\u2011based mechanics with our love of point\u2011and\u2011click adventures. Alongside running, hiding, and surviving the horrors that await you, you will solve puzzles and uncover plots... everything you would expect from a quality point\u2011and\u2011click experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of death animations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are sparing no expense when it comes to the multitude of ways you, your friends, and other unlucky strangers can meet their end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/41b8456124e7b421534c4f5cf031e5e4.poster.avif?t=1774373720\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/extras/41b8456124e7b421534c4f5cf031e5e4.webm?t=1774373720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note - this game is still in early development and is subject to change.</strong></p>","developers":["Bad Tasty"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718500/29376b1593e41c871b05b1cb72754904475349fd/header.jpg?t=1774373720","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718500/968169057/aa07c1bdda90f7f0362015c17325ba168778b9a0/1759221953/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759259135","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718500/968169057/aa07c1bdda90f7f0362015c17325ba168778b9a0/1759221953/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759259135","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3718500/968169057/aa07c1bdda90f7f0362015c17325ba168778b9a0/1759221953/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759259135","id":257209133,"name":"The Bagman Trailer 1","thumbnail":"http